# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Shake&Steer — files Git should ignore
#
# Everything the website actually needs IS committed: the .html pages, the
# folders assets/, i18n/ and downloads/ (including the two PDF menus), plus
# .nojekyll. Only local clutter is listed below.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Python leftovers from the scripts in tools/ ---------------------------
# Created automatically the first time you run make-pdf.py or make-images.py.
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/
env/

# --- Operating system clutter ----------------------------------------------
# Windows Explorer and macOS Finder drop these into folders by themselves.
Thumbs.db
Thumbs.db:encryptable
ehthumbs.db
desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride
._*

# --- Code editors -----------------------------------------------------------
.vscode/
.idea/
*.sublime-workspace
*.code-workspace
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# --- Claude Code -------------------------------------------------------------
# Your own machine's settings. The shared .claude/settings.json, if you ever
# create one, stays in the repository.
.claude/settings.local.json

# --- Working files you don't want on a public website ------------------------
# Anything saved next to a real file as a backup or a draft.
*.bak
*.tmp
*.orig
*.log
*-backup.*
*-copy.*
*.psd
*.ai
*.sketch
/scratch/
/private/

# --- Font files ---------------------------------------------------------------
# make-pdf.py will use a .ttf placed in tools/fonts/ if your system fonts are
# missing. Most commercial fonts (including the Windows ones this project uses
# by default) may not be redistributed, so they are kept out of the repository.
# If you have a font you ARE licensed to share, delete these two lines.
tools/fonts/
*.ttf

# --- Never ignored, listed here as a reminder ---------------------------------
# Un-ignore the PDF menus: they are part of the website, and some global Git
# configs exclude PDFs by habit.
!downloads/*.pdf
